        "detail": "正阳门箭楼 · 京城门面",
        "art": "Qianmen: Zhengyangmen Arrow Tower as seen from Qianmen pedestrian street, the unmistakable massive rectangular GRAY BRICK bastion with rows of small arched arrow windows in the high upper masonry, broad dark-gray tiled multi-eave roof above, large arched gateway in the lower base. Very solid, broad, imposing proportions; NOT Tiananmen, no yellow glazed palace roof, no portrait. A few small front-street shops supply scale."
