        "detail": "雕花老铺 · 老字号烟火",
        "art": "Dashilan pedestrian street: a dense old Beijing commercial street with ornate two-storey historic shopfronts, carved dark wooden doors, layered gray tiled eaves, restrained blue-green painted brackets, small decorative hanging shop boards kept blank, and red lanterns. The lively traditional commercial facades are the landmark, not a single invented gate. Distinct from narrow quiet hutongs: slightly broader street and taller elaborate storefronts."
      },
