        "detail": "斜街书店 · 小院里午餐",
        "art": "Yangmeizhu Xiejie: a gently bending narrow Beijing lane, gray brick low residences with restrained charcoal tiled eaves, an intimate bookshop with books visibly shelved behind a wooden window and a warm small cafe doorway, several simple potted plants. Scholarly intimate adaptive-reuse neighborhood, tactile old brick and muted doors, no huge signboards, no dramatic monuments."
      },
      {
        "name": "琉璃厂",
        "time": "13:20",
